  "description": "+32% on WSFS, Affirm surges, Silver turns profitable. Plus, this week’s stock picks and market gameplan.",
  "body_html": "<h4>What a wonderful week in the market! </h4><p>Took profits on several of our regional banks. Affirm rocketed up for us, after beating analyst estimates by 1,224%…which is just another example of why I always say to ignore mainstream analysts, most of them are atrocious at their jobs. And our silver positions moved into profit 💪</p><p>As always, anything could happen in the market at any given time. But I am expecting another outstanding week ahead of us. The blow off top is providing ample opportunities for us. Enjoy it while it lasts! </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>If you missed any of these posts this week, worry not, all of them below are still relevant. <em><strong>Never</strong></em> feel like you have to catch every post at the exact moment. I invest and trade with you all in mind, knowing that you have busy lives. You never need to be “first” to a post. This is one of many reasons I do not day or short term trade. </p><h4><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/sold-3-of-our-winners-yesterday-heres?r=4z8lgl\">Bought a Stock, and My Market Gameplan</a></strong></h4><h4><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/35-stocks-went-in-these-3-came-out?r=4z8lgl\">Top Stock From Midweek Movers – Mining</a></strong></h4><h4><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/nvidia-im-more-interested-in-bitcoin?r=4z8lgl\">Better Stocks Than Nvidia, Bitcoin &amp; Gold</a></strong></h4><p></p><p>Make sure you take some time off, away from the charts. Do something fun. This is so important, to stay fresh. If you come in Monday, grumpy and tired, you are more likely to make poorer decisions. If you ever have questions, feel free to tag me <em>during market hours</em> in the<strong> <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/d18286d6-5152-4f20-85c8-cedb68ee0e71\">Main Chat</a></strong>. Always happy to explain some of the crazy 🤪 things I say on the internet. We have an incredibly collaborative group of investors and traders, and we all focus on helping each other. Have several financial advisors lurking in there as well (yea…I see you lol). </p><p>I’ll see you Monday, and thanks for stopping by!</p><h4>If you like this week’s content, please like ❤️and re-stack 🔄 this post!</h4><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/a-big-week-for-stocktok-heres-everything?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone into investing? Share this post with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/a-big-week-for-stocktok-heres-everything?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/a-big-week-for-stocktok-heres-everything?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Timothy’s StockTok is a reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, consider becoming a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div>",
